"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Meeting Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">MIN-1986-04-7036</code></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><span style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;padding:.2rem .5rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">&#10003; QUORUM ESTABLISHED</span><span style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">8 of 9 members present</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Attendance</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Title</th><th>Role</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Present</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Veronica Limcharoen</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Marketing</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Procurement Consultant (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Delroy Chapman</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Quality Assurance Specialist</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Monitor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Milagros Wagner</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Manager of Compensation Programs</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Manager</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Tuyen Deshpande</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of International Partnerships</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Independent Director</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Jordyn Wolf</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Organizational Development Specialist</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Public Relations Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Charles Dinh</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Stakeholder Engagement</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Committee Fellow</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Shirley Wanjiku</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Policy</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Turnaround Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Nikolai Dinh</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Senior Manager of Strategic Initiatives</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Vice President</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Agenda</h5><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 1</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Technology Roadmap and Investment Plan for FY1986</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Technology Roadmap and Investment Plan for FY1986 was a review of the company&#x27;s supply chain performance. Milagros Wagner reported that on-time delivery rates had improved to 17%, a 69-point increase from the previous quarter.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for milestones:</strong> RESOLVED, that the IP Licensing Committee approves the recommended approach to Technology Roadmap and Investment Plan for FY1986 as described in Exhibit A, subject to legal review to be completed within 15 days of this meeting.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Tuyen Deshpande &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Charles Dinh</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 5 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 3 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 2</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Enterprise Risk Management Framework — Annual Assessment</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Enterprise Risk Management Framework — Annual Assessment was a review of the company&#x27;s workplace safety record. The number of recordable incidents had decreased by 17% year-over-year. The committee commended the safety team for their efforts.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To adopt with modifications:</strong> RESOLVED, that the IP Licensing Committee approves the recommended approach to Enterprise Risk Management Framework — Annual Assessment as described in Exhibit B, subject to legal review to be completed within 15 days of this meeting.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Shirley Wanjiku &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Veronica Limcharoen</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 8 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 3</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Say-on-Pay Vote Outcome Analysis</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Say-on-Pay Vote Outcome Analysis was a review of the company&#x27;s compliance with Section 162(m) of the Internal Revenue Code. The committee confirmed that all executive compensation was structured to be deductible.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for adoption:</strong> RESOLVED, that the IP Licensing Committee approves the selection of James River Partners as the vendor for the Say-on-Pay Vote Outcome Analysis and authorizes management to execute the final contract.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Charles Dinh &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Tuyen Deshpande</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 8 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 4</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Annual Committee Self-Assessment</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee considered the Annual Committee Self-Assessment, a proposal to adopt a new policy on transfer pricing. The policy was approved and will be implemented company-wide.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for objective:</strong> RESOLVED, that the IP Licensing Committee finds the company to be in compliance with the requirements of NIST Cybersecurity Framework for the fiscal year 1986, based on the attestation provided by management.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Milagros Wagner &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Charles Dinh</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 8 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Action Items</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:2rem\">#</th><th>Description</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">1</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a summary of the company&#x27;s real estate lease obligations</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Astrid Prasetyo</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1986-06-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">2</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a summary of recent changes to executive compensation disclosure rules</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Kavya Idemudia</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1986-05-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">3</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Finalize the performance metrics for the 1986 executive incentive plan</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Xia Ngo</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1986-06-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">4</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a summary of recent shareholder activism trends in the Quick Service Restaurants sector</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Maya Cortez</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1986-06-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">5</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Develop a dashboard for tracking key DEI metrics</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Tigist Smirnov</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1986-05-28</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:#333;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.5rem\">There being no further business, a motion to adjourn was made and carried unanimously. Meeting adjourned at 2:15 PM CT.</p><p style=\"font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#555\"><strong>Next meeting:</strong> 1986-05-14</p><div><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.25rem\">Respectfully submitted,</p><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.1rem\">Nikolai Dinh</p><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#666;margin-bottom:.75rem\">Senior Manager of Strategic Initiatives, Vice President</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2rem\"><div><div style=\"width:160px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Signature</div></div><div><div style=\"width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Approved: ___________</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><a href=\"/archive/1986/04/23/data-science-machine-learning-pay-analysis-2224/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/1986/04/24/facilities-closure-notice-2244/manager-effectiveness-survey-1425/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Next &rarr;</a></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 d-none d-lg-block\"><div style=\"position:sticky;top:2rem\"><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.7rem\">Meeting Record</div><dl class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-size:.82rem\"><dt style=\"opacity:.55